---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import siteData from "../data/site.json";
---

<MainLayout title="Accommodation" description="Boutique comfort in the heart of nature — six thoughtfully designed rooms at Corbett Foothills Retreat near Jim Corbett National Park." breadcrumbs={[{name: "Accommodation"}]}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Product",
      name: "Accommodation at Corbett Foothills Retreat",
      description: "Six thoughtfully designed rooms offering boutique comfort, privacy, and a deep connection with nature near Jim Corbett National Park.",
      brand: { "@type": "Brand", name: "Corbett Foothills Retreat" },
      offers: {
        "@type": "AggregateOffer",
        priceCurrency: "INR",
        lowPrice: "2000",
        highPrice: "4000",
        offerCount: 6,
        availability: "https://schema.org/InStock",
        url: "https://corbett.life/accommodation",
      },
      image: [
        siteData.images.accommodation[0],
        siteData.images.accommodation[1],
        siteData.images.accommodation[2],
      ],
    })} />
  </Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="header">
    <Header />
  </Fragment>

  <section class="relative flex min-h-[40vh] items-end overflow-hidden pt-56">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cfr-green-dark"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-hero-pattern"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-leaf-pattern opacity-30"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 w-full bg-cfr-green-dark">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:pb-16">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <a href="/" class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cfr-sand-300 transition-colors hover:text-white">
            <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18" />
            </svg>
            Back to Home
          </a>
          <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
            Accommodation
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-white">
            Boutique comfort in the heart of nature — six thoughtfully designed rooms at Corbett Foothills Retreat.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Boutique Comfort -->
  <section class="bg-cfr-cream-dark py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-cfr-green-dark sm:text-4xl">Boutique Comfort in the Heart of Nature</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-cfr-earth-600">
          At Corbett Foothills Retreat, accommodation is designed to be more than just a place to sleep — it is an invitation to slow down, reconnect with nature, and experience hospitality in its most personal form.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-cfr-earth-600">
          Unlike large commercial resorts, our boutique retreat features just six thoughtfully designed rooms, allowing us to offer every guest a level of attention, flexibility, and care that is increasingly rare in modern travel. Whether you're visiting for a wildlife safari, a family holiday, a romantic getaway, or simply a peaceful escape from city life, your stay is tailored to your unique preferences and pace.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-cfr-earth-600">
          Surrounded by forested landscapes, fresh mountain air, and the quiet rhythms of nature, every room provides a comfortable sanctuary from the demands of everyday life.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img
            src={siteData.images.accommodation[1]}
            alt="Retreat surrounded by forest"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img
            src={siteData.images.accommodation[2]}
            alt="Peaceful retreat views"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Space, Privacy & Personal Attention -->
  <section class="bg-cfr-green-dark py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Space, Privacy & Personal Attention</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          With only six rooms on the property, Corbett Foothills Retreat offers a sense of exclusivity that larger resorts often cannot match.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          Here, guests are never just room numbers. Our intimate setting allows us to understand individual preferences, accommodate special requests whenever possible, and create a more meaningful and personalized experience for every visitor.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          Whether it is arranging a safari, preparing a special meal, recommending local attractions, or simply ensuring your morning tea is served exactly the way you like it, our team takes pride in the small details that transform a stay into a memorable experience.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Thoughtfully Designed Rooms -->
  <section class="bg-cfr-cream-dark py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-cfr-green-dark sm:text-4xl">Thoughtfully Designed Rooms</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-cfr-earth-600">
          Our rooms are designed to provide a harmonious balance between modern comfort and the natural beauty of the surrounding landscape.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cfr-green-accent text-center">Each room offers:</p>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {
          siteData.roomFeatures.map((f) => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-card">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cfr-green-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-cfr-earth-700">{f}</span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>

      <p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm leading-relaxed text-cfr-earth-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        The design philosophy emphasizes simplicity, comfort, and relaxation, creating an environment where guests can unwind after a day of exploring the Corbett region.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img
            src={siteData.images.accommodation[3]}
            alt="Luxury room style"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img
            src={siteData.images.accommodation[4]}
            alt="Outside shot"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Wake Up to Nature -->
  <section class="bg-cfr-green-dark py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Wake Up to Nature</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          One of the most cherished aspects of staying at Corbett Foothills Retreat is the opportunity to experience nature from the moment you wake up.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          Instead of traffic, horns, and crowded streets, mornings here begin with birdsong, cool mountain air, and gentle sunlight filtering through the surrounding greenery.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          Guests often spend their mornings enjoying tea in the open spaces, taking leisurely walks around the property, or simply relaxing while listening to the sounds of the forest.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          The pace here is intentionally slower, offering a refreshing contrast to the constant rush of urban life.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Perfect for Families -->
  <section class="bg-cfr-cream-dark py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-cfr-green-dark sm:text-4xl">Perfect for Families, Couples & Small Groups</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-cfr-earth-600">
          Whether you are traveling as a couple, a family, or a small group of friends, our accommodation offers the ideal base for exploring Jim Corbett National Park and the surrounding attractions.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-cfr-earth-600">
          The intimate nature of the retreat creates a warm and welcoming atmosphere where guests can enjoy both privacy and shared experiences amidst nature.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cfr-green-accent text-center">Popular among our guests:</p>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {
          siteData.guestTypes.map((g) => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-card">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cfr-green-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
              <span class="text-sm text-cfr-earth-700">{g}</span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pet Friendly -->
  <section class="bg-cfr-green-dark py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="mx-auto flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-cfr-green-accent/20 mb-6">
          <svg class="h-8 w-8 text-cfr-green-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Pet-Friendly Stays</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          At Corbett Foothills Retreat, we understand that pets are family.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          Our pet-friendly environment allows guests to travel with their furry companions and enjoy nature together. Open spaces, fresh air, and a relaxed atmosphere make the retreat a welcoming destination for both guests and their pets.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          We encourage guests planning to travel with pets to contact us in advance so we can help make their stay as comfortable as possible.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img
            src="/images/pet-friendly-2.webp"
            alt="Pet-friendly grounds"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img
            src={siteData.images.accommodation[6]}
            alt="Open spaces for pets"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img
            src="/images/pet-friendly-3.webp"
            alt="Nature surroundings"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- More Than a Room -->
  <section class="bg-cfr-cream-dark py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-cfr-green-dark sm:text-4xl">More Than a Room</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-cfr-earth-600">
          Your stay at Corbett Foothills Retreat extends beyond the comfort of your room.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cfr-green-accent text-center">Guests can enjoy:</p>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {siteData.accommodationMore.map((item) => (
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-4 shadow-card">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cfr-green-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-sm text-cfr-earth-700">{item}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/gallery" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-cfr-green-accent hover:text-cfr-green-dark transition-colors">
          View Photo Gallery
        </a>
        <a href="/tariff" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-cfr-green-accent hover:text-cfr-green-dark transition-colors">
          Check Rates & Pricing
        </a>
        <a href="/blogs/why-choose-a-boutique-stay-near-jim-corbett" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-cfr-green-accent hover:text-cfr-green-dark transition-colors">
          Read: Why Choose a Boutique Stay
        </a>
        <a href="/blogs/things-to-do-jim-corbett" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-cfr-green-accent hover:text-cfr-green-dark transition-colors">
          Explore Things to Do Near Corbett
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-cfr-green-dark py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl whitespace-nowrap">Experience Boutique Hospitality Near Jim Corbett</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          If you are looking for a peaceful retreat that combines personalized service, comfortable accommodation, natural surroundings, and authentic hospitality, Corbett Foothills Retreat offers a refreshing alternative to large commercial resorts.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          With only six rooms, every stay receives the attention it deserves, creating an experience that is intimate, memorable, and deeply connected to the beauty of the Corbett landscape.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white">
          Book your stay and discover the difference that boutique hospitality can make.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/booking/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-cfr-green-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-cfr-green-dark hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cfr-green-accent focus-visible:ring-offset-2 !rounded-full !px-10 !py-4">
            Book Your Stay
          </a>
          <a href="/experiences" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border-2 border-cfr-green-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-cfr-green-accent transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-cfr-green-accent hover:text-white focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cfr-green-accent focus-visible:ring-offset-2 !rounded-full !border-cfr-sand-500 !px-10 !py-4 !text-cfr-sand-200 hover:!bg-cfr-sand-500/20">
            Explore Experiences
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing images -->
  <section class="bg-cfr-cream-dark pb-16 sm:pb-24 pt-6 sm:pt-10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <div class="w-full max-w-4xl overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
          <img
            src={siteData.images.accommodation[8]}
            alt="Corbett Foothills Retreat landscape surrounded by forest"
            class="w-full aspect-[16/9] object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Fragment slot="footer">
    <Footer />
  </Fragment>
</MainLayout>
